  "conclusions": [
    "CCTV-4 overseas and TVBS both played through the Android system video_player fallback. Native SurfaceView startup/buffering was inconsistent on this network.",
    "CCTV-6 resolves to a 16.8 second upstream overload notice; successful rendering does not restore its broadcast.",
    "TrueHD 5.1 sample passed the host native path with H.264 video, a true-hd audio track and rendered-frame/clock progression.",
    "HEVC Main10/E-AC-3 did not pass this TV emulator host run: libmpv reports an EGL context failure and system backends do not recover it. Do not infer all-device compatibility from decoder-only results.",
    "Switching Flutter from Impeller to Skia did not remove the EGL failure. No global renderer opt-out is shipped.",
    "Reducing initial native playback buffering from 1500ms to 1000ms allowed native TVBS frames but still rebuffered and did not improve total fallback time. The original 1500ms/5000ms startup/rebuffer settings are retained.",
    "BufferProfile values are now sent over the host/native boundary to prevent Dart/Kotlin tuning drift. Native fallbacks remain compatible with old callers."
  ],
